The Pyxis recipe builds the pkgconf command and its private static library
closure against the Pyxis SDK. It preserves capability URI scheme slashes and
colons, defaults to sdk://lib/pkgconfig and static output, excludes symlink
traversal (native filesystems do not provide symlinks), and silences diagnostics
through the existing callback rather than opening /dev/null. Pledge/unveil use
upstream's non-OpenBSD implementation; authority remains the native grants.
No host filesystem, subprocess, network or library-download service is added.
